#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Metrics](ca://s?q=Explain_Observability_Metrics)
#    - [Tracing](ca://s?q=Explain_Distributed_Tracing)
#    - [Event Streams](ca://s?q=Explain_Event_Streams)
#    - [Anomaly Detection](ca://s?q=Explain_Anomaly_Detection)
#    - [Export Pipelines](ca://s?q=Explain_Observability_Export_Pipelines)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - gauge(name, value)
#         Sets metric gauge.
#
#    - increment(name, amount)
#         Increments metric counter.
#
#    - start_trace(name)
#         Begins trace span.
#
#    - end_trace(trace_id, meta)
#         Ends trace span.
#
#    - event(subsystem, message, meta)
#         Records event.
#
#    - anomaly(category, details)
#         Flags anomaly.
#
#    - export()
#         Returns recent observability data.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full observability state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  TRACE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "TRC-XXXX",
#      "name": "scheduler.tick",
#      "start": <epoch>,
#      "end": <epoch>,
#      "duration": <seconds>,
#      "meta": { ... }
#    }
#
